%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: DetectiveMonika_checkUpstairs
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: We should check upstairs, just in case there's something important up
      there.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189334
    - rid: 1790118809755189338
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes, captain.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189343
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189444
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Ivar, you check that side of the room, I'll check this side.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118857467756601
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Aye.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118857467756602
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika opens the wardrobe, to see if there's anything damaged or stolen.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189445
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Nope, everything seems to be in order there.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Next, she checks the axe decoratively mounted on the wall.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Still dusty. It's really unlikely that this has any involvement with
      the murder.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: You find anything yet, Ivar?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189446
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: '... maybe? Come look at this:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189447
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: What'd you find?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189448
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: You notice how this piece of wooden support doesn't have any shingles
      over it, 'cause of the light leaking through?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189449
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: You also notice how the bolts that are holding it in place look different
      compared to the other ones?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, these bolts seem newer than the rest of them.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189450
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you think it's possible the culprit removed the bolts to get into
      the building after hours without alerting the two brothers?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189451
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That <i>could</i> explain why Elrindir was able to sleep through the
      murderer entering the building-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189452
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: If the bolts could be quietly removed, it would be safer than just opening
      the front door.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189453
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: This would mean that the murder would <i>have</i> to be pre-meditated-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189454
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: No way a split-second decision would result in such a... well, such a
      scheme.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189455
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Did you find anything else of note?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189456
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Unfortunately, no.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189457
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Let's head back downstairs, then.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189458
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189459
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
